        "raw": "<p>The Blitz Scenario Card reads:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>\"<b>RULE CHANGES</b><br />\r\nAll powers are&nbsp;<a href=\"https://spiritislandwiki.com/index.php?title=File:Fasticon.png\">![Fasticon.png|25x21](upload://sj4pORn0948XefkNY3SLPKIfTHM.png)</a><br />\r\nPowers which were already&nbsp;<a href=\"https://spiritislandwiki.com/index.php?title=File:Fasticon.png\">![Fasticon.png|25x21](upload://sj4pORn0948XefkNY3SLPKIfTHM.png)</a>&nbsp;(or made&nbsp;<a href=\"https://spiritislandwiki.com/index.php?title=File:Fasticon.png\">![Fasticon.png|25x21](upload://sj4pORn0948XefkNY3SLPKIfTHM.png)</a>) cost 1 less Energy.&nbsp;(For Innate Powers and Power Cards cost 0, instead gain 1 Energy.)<br />\r\nWhen Exploring, once per board, add an additional&nbsp;<a href=\"https://spiritislandwiki.com/index.php?title=File:Explorericon.png\">![Explorericon.png|15x25](upload://x2xZWTQ1JIhmZjQs4HkAoYM6j7S.png)</a>.<br />\r\nIf the Island becomes \"Blighted\", put 1 less&nbsp;<a href=\"https://spiritislandwiki.com/index.php?title=File:Blighticon.png\">![Blighticon.png|25x26](upload://em6JBHdAgZscfNokStfcBgob6sB.png)</a>&nbsp;per player on the Blight Card.\"</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>My question is:&nbsp;when you add the additional&nbsp;<em><a href=\"https://spiritislandwiki.com/index.php?title=File:Explorericon.png\">![Explorericon.png|15x25](upload://x2xZWTQ1JIhmZjQs4HkAoYM6j7S.png)</a></em>, do you add them in the Land type shown or in any land of your choosing?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I played with the latter, because if it were the former the Scenario Card would look something like this:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>\"<b>RULE CHANGES</b><br />\r\nAll powers are&nbsp;<a href=\"https://spiritislandwiki.com/index.php?title=File:Fasticon.png\">![Fasticon.png|25x21](upload://sj4pORn0948XefkNY3SLPKIfTHM.png)</a><br />\r\nPowers which were already&nbsp;<a href=\"https://spiritislandwiki.com/index.php?title=File:Fasticon.png\">![Fasticon.png|25x21](upload://sj4pORn0948XefkNY3SLPKIfTHM.png)</a>&nbsp;(or made&nbsp;<a href=\"https://spiritislandwiki.com/index.php?title=File:Fasticon.png\">![Fasticon.png|25x21](upload://sj4pORn0948XefkNY3SLPKIfTHM.png)</a>) cost 1 less Energy.&nbsp;(For Innate Powers and Power Cards cost 0, instead gain 1 Energy.)<br />\r\nWhen Exploring, once per board i<u>n the shown Land Type</u>, add an additional&nbsp;<a href=\"https://spiritislandwiki.com/index.php?title=File:Explorericon.png\">![Explorericon.png|15x25](upload://x2xZWTQ1JIhmZjQs4HkAoYM6j7S.png)</a>.<br />\r\nIf the Island becomes \"Blighted\", put 1 less&nbsp;<a href=\"https://spiritislandwiki.com/index.php?title=File:Blighticon.png\">![Blighticon.png|25x26](upload://em6JBHdAgZscfNokStfcBgob6sB.png)</a>&nbsp;per player on the Blight Card.\"</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>I tried to find an answer in the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq\" rel=\"nofollow\">online, mobile-friendly living FAQ</a>, but it didn't have an answer.</p>",
