        "created_at": "2019-04-07T22:16:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>No offense taken! Years of editing and playtesting; I'm an editor of the game, and wrote most of the FAQ entries. (And it's my fault the card is a little ambiguous here.)</p>\n<p>Concretely, there's a more subtle answer. In this case, the&nbsp;question was asked before on BoardGameGeek:&nbsp;https://boardgamegeek.com/thread/2006017/blitz-additional-explorer . The person answering isn't authoritative, but the answer was tipped by darker, aka Eric Reuss, the designer; this is his signal that the answer was 100% correct and needs no further clarification.</p>\n<p>I'll add a note to clarify the wording in some eventual future printing.</p>",
